### PATCH
PATCH http://localhost:3000/tasks/complete/2


### PATCH
PATCH http://localhost:3000/tasks/incomplete/3


### DELETE
DELETE http://localhost:3000/tasks/delete/<REPLACE WITH ACTUAL ID>



### PUT
PUT http://localhost:3000/tasks/edit/<REPLACE WITH ACTUAL ID>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Test Task (edited)",
  "dueDate": "2028-07-23"
}
